---
description: "Use the ux-doctor skills when building, auditing, reviewing or restyling UI (styling, layout, typography, colour, spacing, forms)."
alwaysApply: false
---

- Building or changing UI: load the `ux-build` skill (project tokens first, then `references/defaults.md` and the Critical 20 in the `ux-doctor` skill folder).
- Judging UI: load `ux-doctor`, then `/ux-audit`, `/ux-review` or `/ux-restyle`; look rules up with `/ux-rules` or `node <ux-doctor skill folder>/scripts/rule.mjs <ID|tag|keyword>`.
- Project rules (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.cursor/rules/*`, `DESIGN.md`) outrank playbook rules.
